{
  "format": "tugql-slash-paths-suite",
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "TugQL FROM slash-path conformance vectors, shared by dal-go/dalgo (Go) and dal-go/dalgo-js (TypeScript), which vendors this file byte for byte at test/testdata/tugql/slash-paths/cases.json. Both implementations must satisfy every case. The file is protected by manifest.sha256 in this directory.",
    "Spec: datatug/backstage spec/features/my-data-project REQ slash-path-from. In FROM (and JOIN) a source path may use `/` as its segment separator. The last segment is `name`; the earlier segments joined with `/` are `schema`. Mixing `.` and `/` in one path is an error.",
    "A segment is a bare word, a quoted identifier (\"...\" or `...`), or `{name}` (the tokens `{`, word, `}` with no whitespace between them); `{name}` must be a whole segment and is allowed only in a `/` path. A quoted segment (in a `/` or a `.` path) may not be empty and may not contain `{`, `}` or `/`. `/` must touch the segments on both sides, so a path cannot break across lines. `//` touching a path segment is an empty-segment error (not a comment); `//` after whitespace is still a comment. A clause keyword (from, join, select, ...) used as a bare segment is rejected by the one-clause-per-line rule; quote it.",
    "Each case has `text` and exactly one of `expected.from` or `expected.error`.",
    "expected.from: the parsed tree's query.from object (including joins), compared for deep equality (keys absent here are absent from the tree; a tree without an alias key exposes the collection name as its alias). expected.alias: the alias the source exposes, i.e. from.alias when present, otherwise from.name. expected.print: the text produced by printing the parsed tree (Go PrintTugQL); it must re-parse to the same tree. The tree does not record which separator the author used: a source prints in slash form when its schema contains `/` or a segment is `{name}` (and every segment can be spelled in a slash path); otherwise it prints in the dotted form, so `users/projects` prints as `users.projects`. expected.comments: the texts of the comments the parse keeps, in order (omitted means none).",
    "expected.error: the parse fails and the FIRST diagnostic (diagnostics[0]) has this `code` and its span starts at 1-based `line` and `column` (columns count code points). Later diagnostics and messages are not compared."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "slash-from-parses-to-schema-and-name",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug/projects",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug",
          "name": "projects"
        },
        "alias": "projects",
        "print": "from spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug/projects"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "slash-from-with-alias",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug/projects AS p",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug",
          "name": "projects",
          "alias": "p"
        },
        "alias": "p",
        "print": "from spaces/{SneatUserPersonalSpaceID}/ext/datatug/projects as p"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "quoted-last-segment",
      "text": "FROM spaces/abc/ext/datatug/\"user projects\"",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces/abc/ext/datatug",
          "name": "user projects"
        },
        "alias": "user projects",
        "print": "from spaces/abc/ext/datatug/\"user projects\""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "two-segment-path",
      "text": "FROM users/projects",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "users",
          "name": "projects"
        },
        "alias": "projects",
        "print": "from users.projects"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-collection-name",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{space}",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces",
          "name": "{space}"
        },
        "alias": "{space}",
        "print": "from spaces/{space}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dot-path-unchanged",
      "text": "FROM a.b",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "a",
          "name": "b"
        },
        "alias": "b",
        "print": "from a.b"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "spaced-comment-after-source",
      "text": "FROM users // note",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "name": "users"
        },
        "alias": "users",
        "print": "from users -- note",
        "comments": [
          "note"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-segment-between-slashes",
      "text": "FROM spaces//ext",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "touching-double-slash-after-single-name",
      "text": "FROM users//note",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 12}}
    },
    {
      "name": "touching-double-slash-before-space",
      "text": "FROM users// note",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 12}}
    },
    {
      "name": "leading-slash",
      "text": "FROM /x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "trailing-slash",
      "text": "FROM x/",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 7}}
    },
    {
      "name": "trailing-slash-before-alias",
      "text": "FROM x/ AS y",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "detached_path_separator", "line": 1, "column": 7}}
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed-dot-then-slash",
      "text": "FROM a.b/c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "mixed_path_separators", "line": 1, "column": 9}}
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed-slash-then-dot",
      "text": "FROM a/b.c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "mixed_path_separators", "line": 1, "column": 9}}
    },
    {
      "name": "quoted-segment-contains-brace",
      "text": "FROM spaces/\"{x}\"/ext/datatug/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_quoted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "quoted-segment-contains-slash",
      "text": "FROM spaces/\"a/b\"/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_quoted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "quoted-first-segment-contains-close-brace",
      "text": "FROM \"a}\"/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_quoted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "slash-not-touching-segments",
      "text": "FROM spaces / abc/ext/datatug/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "detached_path_separator", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "slash-not-touching-next-segment",
      "text": "FROM spaces/ abc",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "detached_path_separator", "line": 1, "column": 12}}
    },
    {
      "name": "number-segment-must-be-quoted",
      "text": "FROM spaces/2024/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-with-spaces",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{ x }/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-unclosed",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{x/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-first-segment-with-spaces",
      "text": "FROM { x }/projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-in-dot-path",
      "text": "FROM {x}.projects",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-alone",
      "text": "FROM {x}",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "backtick-quoted-segment",
      "text": "FROM spaces/`user projects`",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces",
          "name": "user projects"
        },
        "alias": "user projects",
        "print": "from spaces.\"user projects\""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "quoted-keyword-segment",
      "text": "FROM spaces/\"from\"/x",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces/from",
          "name": "x"
        },
        "alias": "x",
        "print": "from spaces/\"from\"/x"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dash-comment-touching-path",
      "text": "FROM a/b--note",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "a",
          "name": "b"
        },
        "alias": "b",
        "print": "from a.b -- note",
        "comments": [
          "note"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "join-slash-path",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{s}/ext/datatug/projects AS p\nJOIN spaces/{s}/ext/datatug/members AS m\n  ON m.project = p.id\nSELECT p.id",
      "expected": {
        "from": {
          "schema": "spaces/{s}/ext/datatug",
          "name": "projects",
          "alias": "p",
          "joins": [
            {
              "from": {
                "schema": "spaces/{s}/ext/datatug",
                "name": "members",
                "alias": "m"
              },
              "on": [
                {
                  "left": {
                    "source": "m",
                    "field": "project"
                  },
                  "op": "==",
                  "right": {
                    "source": "p",
                    "field": "id"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "alias": "p",
        "print": "from spaces/{s}/ext/datatug/projects as p\njoin spaces/{s}/ext/datatug/members as m\n  on m.project = p.id\nselect p.id"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "double-slash-only-is-a-comment",
      "text": "FROM //x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_from", "line": 1, "column": 1}}
    },
    {
      "name": "touching-double-slash-in-dot-path",
      "text": "FROM a.b//c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 10}}
    },
    {
      "name": "touching-double-slash-at-end",
      "text": "FROM x//",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "bare-clause-keyword-segment",
      "text": "from spaces/from/x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "multiple_clauses_same_line", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "path-broken-after-slash",
      "text": "FROM spaces/\n  abc/x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "detached_path_separator", "line": 1, "column": 12}}
    },
    {
      "name": "path-broken-before-slash",
      "text": "FROM spaces/abc\n  /x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "detached_path_separator", "line": 2, "column": 3}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-after-dot",
      "text": "FROM a.{x}",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-with-suffix",
      "text": "FROM spaces/{x}y/z",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "substituted-segment-with-prefix",
      "text": "FROM spaces/x{y}/z",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_substituted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-quoted-middle-segment",
      "text": "FROM a/\"\"/c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-quoted-first-segment",
      "text": "FROM \"\"/c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-quoted-last-segment",
      "text": "FROM spaces/\"\"",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 13}}
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-quoted-dot-segment",
      "text": "FROM a.\"\"",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 1, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-quoted-join-segment",
      "text": "FROM a\nJOIN a/\"\"/b AS q\n  ON q.x = a.x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 2, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "touching-double-slash-in-join",
      "text": "FROM a\nJOIN b//c\n  ON b.x = a.x",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "empty_path_segment", "line": 2, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "dot-path-quoted-segment-contains-brace",
      "text": "FROM a.\"{x}\"",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_quoted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 8}}
    },
    {
      "name": "dot-path-quoted-segment-contains-slash",
      "text": "FROM \"a/b\".c",
      "expected": {"error": {"code": "invalid_quoted_segment", "line": 1, "column": 6}}
    }
  ]
}
